    "report": "相同之处：两条都说明在标准大气压下水的沸点是 100 摄氏度。证据：src-zh version 1 sha256 9d900e333ed6c184ab98508deea28dcd7778543df6aa385fc88fffee6ad9f360 offset 0-92；src-en version 1 sha256 135a0c89a341d29d83d973a3b78b5933f4f02dddd2f475d04d224bb1c2534f71 offset 0-283。两条也都没有声称这个沸点在高原上仍然相同。证据：src-zh version 1 sha256 9d900e333ed6c184ab98508deea28dcd7778543df6aa385fc88fffee6ad9f360 offset 0-92；src-en version 1 sha256 135a0c89a341d29d83d973a3b78b5933f4f02dddd2f475d04d224bb1c2534f71 offset 0-283。\n\n不同之处：容器不同，src-zh 是玻璃烧杯，src-en 是钢烧杯。证据：src-zh version 1 sha256 9d900e333ed6c184ab98508deea28dcd7778543df6aa385fc88fffee6ad9f360 offset 0-92；src-en version 1 sha256 135a0c89a341d29d83d973a3b78b5933f4f02dddd2f475d04d224bb1c2534f71 offset 0-283。加热工具不同，src-zh 用酒精灯，src-en 用电热板。证据：src-zh version 1 sha256 9d900e333ed6c184ab98508deea28dcd7778543df6aa385fc88fffee6ad9f360 offset 0-92；src-en version 1 sha256 135a0c89a341d29d83d973a3b78b5933f4f02dddd2f475d04d224bb1c2534f71 offset 0-283。",
